    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"border:2px dotted darkgray; margin-top:0.5em; margin-bottom:1em; padding:0 0.5em;\">\n<p>欢迎来到  <b>女皇之刃Wiki沙盒</b>!<br />\n\n此页面供你练习编辑或排版(参见  <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Editing\" title=\"Help:Editing\">帮助：编辑</a>)而不会更改任何重要内容。请随意在此先尝试维基编辑。<br />\n\n这里有一个  <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Tutorial_1\" title=\"Help:Tutorial 1\">教程</a>  关于中央(协调性)Wikia，它会引导你了解更多你能做的事情。Wiki允许相当复杂的格式化。开始时可能让人不知所措，但别担心。从基础开始……输入一些文本，然后逐步学习其他部分。你的内容贡献是受欢迎且重要的。Wiki是一项协作努力，其他人可以帮助格式化和其他改进。<br />\n\n最美好的祝愿！\n\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"QBGOVA2-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:145px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:QBGOVA2.jpg\" title=\"QBGOVA2.jpg (215 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:145px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/14/QBGOVA2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/145?cb=20161022181613\" title=\"QBGOVA2.jpg (215 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"QBGOVA2.jpg\" data-image-key=\"QBGOVA2.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"QBGOVA2.jpg (215 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"QBGOVA2.jpg\" data-image-key=\"QBGOVA2.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/14/QBGOVA2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/145?cb=20161022181613\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<table style=\"float: right; background-color:Black; width:300px; border: 1px solid #6e0410; font-size:89%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#6e0410; color:White; font-size: 130%; padding:15px;\">哈哈，真有趣\n\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/14/QBGOVA2.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20161022181613\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"QBGOVA2\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/14/QBGOVA2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20161022181613\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"255\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"QBGOVA2.jpg\" data-image-key=\"QBGOVA2.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>播出日期</b></td>\n<td>20216年9月280日\n\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#6e0410; color:White;\">信息\n\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#6e0410; color:White;\">剧集指南\n\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align:center;\" valign=\"top\">\n<td><b>上一个</b><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Awaken,_Demon_Hunter_of_Little_Red_Riding_Hood\" title=\"Awaken, Demon Hunter of Little Red Riding Hood\">第1集</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>下一个</b><br />待定\n\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>此页面用于任何测试。\n\n</p><p>欢迎来到沙盒！\n\n</p><p>任何人都可以编辑此页面。\n\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Simple_Editing\">简单编辑</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FQueen%2527s_Blade_Wiki%3ASandbox%3Faction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>要编辑页面，请点击「编辑」标签，通常位于页面顶部附近。然后，编辑页面中的框。欢迎在此页面上练习。它就是为了让你练习而存在的。\n\n</p><p>空行表示段落分隔。\n\n</p><p>您可以通过将页面的名称或标题放在双括号中来链接到另一个页面。 \n[[Main Page]] 变成  <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Page\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Main Page\">主页面</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Simple_Formatting\">简单格式化</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FQueen%2527s_Blade_Wiki%3ASandbox%3Faction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>通过在重复的等号(=)之间放置文本创建标题。等号越多，标题级别越低。\n\n</p><p>通过在每项前加星号(*)创建项目符号列表。\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>犯编辑错误没关系</li>\n<li>您可以在保存前预览您的作品</li>\n<li>即使保存后，您或其他人也可以再次编辑，使其更好</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Formatting_for_Emphasis\">强调格式</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FQueen%2527s_Blade_Wiki%3ASandbox%3Faction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>在单词或短语周围加上单引号以进行强调格式。\n\n</p><p>两个单引号，如''斜体''将创建  <i>斜体</i>.\n</p><p>三个单引号，如'''粗体文本'''将创建  <b>粗体文本</b>.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>其他内容……\n\n</p><p>如果您了解HTML或CSS格式化命令，它们也可以在此Wiki中使用。一个有用的HTML命令是&lt;br /&gt;，它创建换行。\n\n</p><p>如果您想显示命令的样貌，而不是实际执行命令，请将其包围在  <b>nowiki</b>  命令。\n\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821085224\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 73/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2264/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 137/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1459/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   16.588      1 Template:Sandbox\n100.00%   16.588      1 -total\n 21.01%    3.485      1 Template:Episode_Infobox\n  7.98%    1.324      1 Template:!!\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:1518-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260821085224 and revision id 3020. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
